    arrangement: ["calm_a", "calm_b", "tension", "battle_a", "battle_b", "breakdown", "battle_b", "victory"],
    notes: "ARC battle. C minor, 120 bpm. calm 0-0.3 (Seed motif on the bell in calm_b), tension 0.25-0.6 (gallop + taiko, roll into the fight), battle 0.55-1 (horn melody in battle_b above 0.7). Layers: ostinato fades in from 0.15, stabs from 0.58, drone and arp fade out above 0.6 / 0.45. Strings brighten with intensity (follow Cutoff). Stingers: nuke, commander_lost, enemy_commander, titan. Endings: victory (picardy C major), defeat. | Proposal A (Winter Contingency chart): 104 bpm, battle i5-#IV-i5-bVI / i-bVI-iv-#IV in open fifths, tension on a C pedal with Db (bII).",
)
